('128.6.b.13.H',3,'A student presents research with a slide show and a short speech. The mode is:','["silent only", "written only", "none", "multimodal"]'::jsonb,3,'More than one mode is multimodal.','original'),
('128.6.b.13.H',2,'Which delivery is a written mode?','["a printed report", "a song", "a skit", "a speech"]'::jsonb,0,'Written delivery is on paper or screen text.','original'),
('128.6.b.2.A.i',4,'Palabras sobresdrújulas are stressed:','["on the next-to-last syllable", "before the third-to-last syllable", "on no syllable", "on the last syllable"]'::jsonb,1,'Sobresdrújulas, like cómpramelo, have stress earlier than the antepenultimate syllable.','original'),
('128.6.b.2.A.i',3,'Which word is esdrújula?','["café", "mesa", "murciélago", "jardín"]'::jsonb,2,'Murciélago is stressed on the third-to-last syllable.','original'),
