('128.6.b.2.A.iii',3,'Which word means ''tea'' and carries a diacritical accent?','["te", "té", "tê", "tè"]'::jsonb,1,'Té with an accent is tea; te is a pronoun.','original'),
('128.6.b.2.A.iii',3,'Why is dé (give) different from de (of)?','["de is plural", "dé is a noun only", "the accent marks a different meaning", "dé is longer"]'::jsonb,2,'A diacritical accent separates words that sound alike.','original'),
