('128.6.b.7.D',3,'A summary of a text should be:','["unrelated to the text", "full of new facts", "longer than the text", "shorter than the text and keep its main ideas"]'::jsonb,3,'Summaries are brief and accurate.','original'),
('128.6.b.7.D',3,'Which is a retelling in logical order?','["First, the team lost; then they practiced; finally they won.", "Finally they won; first they practiced; the team lost.", "They practiced; finally the team lost; first they won.", "Won, lost, practiced, never."]'::jsonb,0,'Retellings keep logical order.','original'),
('128.6.b.7.E',3,'Freewriting after reading is a way to:','["copy a page", "explore your thoughts about the text", "edit spelling only", "avoid the text"]'::jsonb,1,'Freewriting is a response strategy.','original'),
