('128.6.b.7.F',3,'A student learns the word ''determined'' and writes: ''The determined girl practiced every day.'' This is:','["a rhyme", "a caption", "an index entry", "using new vocabulary in a response"]'::jsonb,3,'Using new words shows learning.','original'),
